{"ticker":{"symbol":"386380.KQ","name":"스카이랩스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":7620.0,"change_pct":-0.04630788485607007,"market_cap":142966259712.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":39350.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.skylabs.io/en","business_summary":"Sky Labs Inc. manufactures CART BP pro, a ring-type medical device as a blood pressure monitoring solution for healthcare professionals and patients. The company provides health monitoring services to prevent chronic disease as an AI healthcare platform company. Additionally, it develops CART ON, a healthcare platform that collects, analyzes, diagnoses, and distributes data from outpatients with chronic diseases. The company's device CART BP pro helps with accurate diagnosis and individualized medication by offering 24-hour ambulatory blood pressure monitoring data and health evaluation metrics. Sky Labs Inc. was founded in 2015 and is based in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"스카이랩스는 의료 전문가와 환자를 위한 혈압 모니터링 솔루션인 링형 의료기기인 CART BP pro를 제조합니다. AI 헬스케어 플랫폼 기업으로 만성질환 예방을 위한 건강 모니터링 서비스를 제공하고 있다. 또한, 만성질환 외래환자의 데이터를 수집, 분석, 진단, 유통하는 헬스케어 플랫폼인 CART ON을 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사의 장치인 CART BP pro는 24시간 보행 혈압 모니터링 데이터와 건강 평가 지표를 제공하여 정확한 진단과 개별화된 약물 치료를 돕습니다. 스카이랩스(Sky Labs Inc.)는 2015년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"의료기기","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":480626140.0,"operating_income":-8637615030.0,"net_income":-3495645300.0,"eps":-49298.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":589269420.0,"operating_income":-7800240850.0,"net_income":-13858007340.0,"eps":-97215.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":4090822370.0,"operating_income":-11729448860.0,"net_income":-12667531